{"version":1,"content":"<p>殿堂級填詞人兼演員黎彼得今年8月病逝。</p><p>好友鍾志光今日（4日）於社交平台分享黎彼得骨灰龕位的照片，並留言感嘆：「浪子半世詞作，成就一生精彩。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T10:42:23.232464+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":72,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:57:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:38:21.733430+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:35:14.600771+00:00","content_hash":"def1c75349b529fedc2c398a2330f573389816889b5755a68a1b71252b449fd2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}